title: "Architecture of Infinity: Prime Coordinates and BIP-39 Mnemonic Research"
message: "If you use this repository, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: "Tomas"
    family-names: "Sanchez Exposito"
    alias: "tomassanchezexposito"
repository-code: "https://github.com/tomassanchezexposito/BIP39-prime-entropy-research"
url: "https://github.com/tomassanchezexposito/BIP39-prime-entropy-research"
abstract: >-
  Experimental research repository on BIP-39 mnemonic generation,
  entropy construction, SHA-256 checksum analysis, prime-number positional
  mappings, Bitcoin wallet security, Native SegWit derivation, reproducible
  Python tooling, and public experimental mnemonic datasets. Prime-number
  mappings are treated as deterministic representations and are not claimed
  to add cryptographic entropy.
